roblems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 10 (page does not exist)\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 12 (page does not exist)\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 13 (page does not exist)\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 14 (page does not exist)\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 15 (page does not exist)\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 16 (page does not exist)\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 17 (page does not exist)\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 18 (page does not exist)\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 19 (page does not exist)\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 20 (page does not exist)\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 21 (page does not exist)\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 22 (page does not exist)\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 23 (page does not exist)\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_24&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 24 (page does not exist)\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1999_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_25&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1999 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 25 (page does not exist)\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"CEMC Fermat\">CEMC Fermat</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017192601\nCache ex